{
  "name": "Agency OS 10 \u00b7 Client Health & Churn Predictor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Client Health & Churn Predictor\n**Inbox listener (hourly):** when a client emails you, `last_client_reply` updates automatically (matched by address or company domain).\n\n**Friday 16:00 scoring (0-100):**\n| Signal | Points |\n|---|---|\n| Results: key events MoM | 40 |\n| Responsiveness: days since the client last replied | 20 |\n| Billing: overdue invoices | 20 |\n| Delivery: approvals stuck near their publish date | 20 |\n\nScores of 75+ are healthy, 50-74 are watch, and under 50 are at-risk. Scores are saved to **Health** and **Clients**. For watch and at-risk clients, **Brain (churn-prevention)** writes a save plan with call talking points and posts it to leadership.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "e3e9f40c-37a5-4574-b794-e6fed7c286ad",
      "name": "Note 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -400
      ]
    },
